cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PAR(2) reproducibility: analysis code and expected results"
message: "If you use this code, please cite both this repository and the paper it reproduces."
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, dataset accessions and expected results for the published PAR(2)
  papers. The MIT licence below covers this repository only; the AR(2) fitting comes
  from the par2-circadian package, which is licensed for noncommercial use, so the
  pipeline as a whole is noncommercial.
